# Mutation reports and any stray sandbox/backup artifacts
reports/
*.psmut-orig

# Scoped mutation configs from tools/New-PSMutantScopedConfig.ps1. Generated per change
# for the local edit-run-edit loop, and deliberately untracked: a committed one looks like
# a gate config while measuring a subset, which is the one way this tool could do harm.
psmutant.scoped.config.json

# Pester's default code-coverage output. Generated by any local coverage run, so
# it dirties the tree every time -- the runner already steers its OWN coverage to
# temp for this reason (see PSMutation.Runner.ps1).
coverage.xml

# Agent skills fetched with `gh skills install` (github/awesome-copilot). Third-party,
# unverified, and reinstallable on demand -- not part of the project source.
.agents/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
